flowchart LR
    IMPORT[Import pinned definition] --> EDIT[Semantic draft and inert layout]
    EDIT --> SAVE[Conditional atomic save]
    SAVE -->|Conflict| MERGE[Base-local-remote review]
    MERGE --> EDIT
    SAVE --> VALIDATE[Owner validation bound to content]
    VALIDATE -->|Diagnostics| EDIT
    VALIDATE -->|Valid| PUBLISH[Publish immutable revision]
    PUBLISH --> START[Explicit start with current admission]
    PUBLISH --> FORK[Fork next draft]
    FORK --> EDIT
